-- TESTS — Part 3 (ss 26-41) and regs 20-25.

§ `Tests — management of cats`

§§ `s 26 — cat control notices`

#ASSERT     `on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `,` "City of Perth"    `may give` `Alex` `a cat control notice for` `Alex's registered cat`
#ASSERT NOT `on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `,` "City of Stirling" `may give` `Alex` `a cat control notice for` `Alex's registered cat`
#ASSERT NOT `on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `,` "City of Perth"    `may give` `Carl` `a cat control notice for` `Alex's registered cat`
#ASSERT count `s 26(2) — what a cat control notice is to do` EQUALS 4

§§ `s 27 — seizure`

GIVEN a IS AN Authorisation
GIVETH AN Officer
`an officer` a MEANS Officer WITH `authorisation` IS a, `an employee of the local government` IS TRUE

`the ranger` MEANS `an officer` `appointed under the Local Government Act 1995 s 9.10(2) for the purposes of the Cat Act`
`a clerk`    MEANS `an officer` `no authorisation under the Cat Act`

GIVEN place   IS A `Place of seizure`
      belief  IS A BOOLEAN
      consent IS A BOOLEAN
      warrant IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A Seizure
`a seizure in` place `; belief` belief `; consent` consent `; warrant` warrant MEANS
    Seizure WITH
        `place` IS place
        `believes or suspects on reasonable grounds the cat is the subject of an offence` IS belief
        `at the request or with the consent of the owner or occupier` IS consent
        `under a warrant issued under Part 4 Division 3 Subdivision 3` IS warrant

#ASSERT     `s 27 permits` `the ranger` `to make` (`a seizure in` `a public place` `; belief` TRUE  `; consent` FALSE `; warrant` FALSE)      -- (a)
#ASSERT NOT `s 27 permits` `the ranger` `to make` (`a seizure in` `a public place` `; belief` FALSE `; consent` TRUE  `; warrant` FALSE)
#ASSERT     `s 27 permits` `the ranger` `to make` (`a seizure in` `premises lawfully entered` `; belief` FALSE `; consent` TRUE  `; warrant` FALSE)   -- (b)(i)
#ASSERT     `s 27 permits` `the ranger` `to make` (`a seizure in` `premises lawfully entered` `; belief` FALSE `; consent` FALSE `; warrant` TRUE)    -- (b)(ii)
#ASSERT NOT `s 27 permits` `the ranger` `to make` (`a seizure in` `premises lawfully entered` `; belief` TRUE  `; consent` FALSE `; warrant` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 27 permits` `a clerk`    `to make` (`a seizure in` `a public place` `; belief` TRUE  `; consent` FALSE `; warrant` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 27 permits` `the ranger` `to make` (`a seizure in` `elsewhere` `; belief` TRUE  `; consent` TRUE  `; warrant` TRUE)

§§ `s 28 — what becomes of a seized cat`

#ASSERT     `s 28 is complied with by` `taken to its owner`
#ASSERT     `s 28 is complied with by` (`impounded in a facility` (Facility WITH `used, or may be used, for keeping cats` IS TRUE, `operator` IS `operated by a local government`))
#ASSERT NOT `s 28 is complied with by` (`impounded in a facility` (Facility WITH `used, or may be used, for keeping cats` IS TRUE, `operator` IS `operated by another person or body`))
#ASSERT NOT `s 28 is complied with by` `something else`

§§ `Facility stays`

GIVEN entered    IS A DATE
      temporary  IS A BOOLEAN
      known      IS A BOOLEAN
      identified IS A MAYBE DATE
      notified   IS A MAYBE DATE
      holding    IS A NUMBER
      reclaimed  IS A MAYBE DATE
      surrendered IS A BOOLEAN
      feral      IS A BOOLEAN
      injurious  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Facility stay`
`a stay from` entered `; temporary` temporary `; owner known` known `; identified` identified `; notified` notified `; holding` holding `; reclaimed` reclaimed `; surrendered` surrendered `; feral` feral `; injurious` injurious MEANS
    `Facility stay` WITH
        `date the cat entered`                       IS entered
        `kept temporarily at the owner's request`    IS temporary
        `operator knew the owner on entry`           IS known
        `date the owner was identified`              IS identified
        `date notice given under section 32`         IS notified
        `holding period specified in the notice, in working days` IS holding
        `date reclaimed`                             IS reclaimed
        `surrendered by the owner`                   IS surrendered
        `operator believes the cat feral, diseased or dangerous` IS feral
        `operator believes the cat has caused, or is likely to cause, serious injury or illness` IS injurious

-- A stray that arrives on Fri 5 Dec 2025, owner unknown.
`the stray's stay` MEANS `a stay from` (YMD 2025 12 5) `; temporary` FALSE `; owner known` FALSE `; identified` NOTHING `; notified` NOTHING `; holding` 0 `; reclaimed` NOTHING `; surrendered` FALSE `; feral` FALSE `; injurious` FALSE
`a boarding stay` MEANS `a stay from` (YMD 2025 12 5) `; temporary` TRUE `; owner known` TRUE `; identified` NOTHING `; notified` NOTHING `; holding` 0 `; reclaimed` NOTHING `; surrendered` FALSE `; feral` FALSE `; injurious` FALSE

§§ `s 29-30 — identifying the owner`

GIVEN attempt  IS A BOOLEAN
      possible IS A BOOLEAN
      scanned  IS A BOOLEAN
      aggressive IS A BOOLEAN
      danger   IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `Identification attempt`
`an attempt:` attempt `; scan possible` possible `; scanned` scanned `; aggressive` aggressive `; danger` danger MEANS
    `Identification attempt` WITH
        `made every reasonable attempt as soon as practicable`  IS attempt
        `scanning was possible`                                 IS possible
        `scanned the cat`                                       IS scanned
        `the cat behaved aggressively`                          IS aggressive
        `believed on reasonable grounds scanning was dangerous` IS danger

#ASSERT     `s 30(1) is contravened during` `the stray's stay` `by` (`an attempt:` FALSE `; scan possible` TRUE  `; scanned` TRUE  `; aggressive` FALSE `; danger` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 30(1) is contravened during` `the stray's stay` `by` (`an attempt:` TRUE  `; scan possible` TRUE  `; scanned` TRUE  `; aggressive` FALSE `; danger` FALSE)
-- "where possible, by scanning": possible but not done.
#ASSERT     `s 30(1) is contravened during` `the stray's stay` `by` (`an attempt:` TRUE  `; scan possible` TRUE  `; scanned` FALSE `; aggressive` FALSE `; danger` FALSE)
-- (2): aggressive AND a reasonable belief of danger excuses not scanning;
-- aggression alone does not.
#ASSERT NOT `s 30(1) is contravened during` `the stray's stay` `by` (`an attempt:` TRUE  `; scan possible` TRUE  `; scanned` FALSE `; aggressive` TRUE  `; danger` TRUE)
#ASSERT     `s 30(1) is contravened during` `the stray's stay` `by` (`an attempt:` TRUE  `; scan possible` TRUE  `; scanned` FALSE `; aggressive` TRUE  `; danger` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 30(1) is contravened during` `the stray's stay` `by` (`an attempt:` TRUE  `; scan possible` FALSE `; scanned` FALSE `; aggressive` FALSE `; danger` FALSE)
-- s 29: the Division does not apply to a cat boarded at its owner's request.
#ASSERT NOT `s 30(1) is contravened during` `a boarding stay` `by` (`an attempt:` FALSE `; scan possible` TRUE  `; scanned` FALSE `; aggressive` FALSE `; danger` FALSE)

§§ `s 31 — costs`

`the costs` MEANS
    `Facility costs` WITH
        `removing and impounding the cat`                IS 50
        `keeping and caring for the cat`                 IS 70
        `implanting a microchip under section 33`        IS 60
        `sterilising the cat under section 33`           IS 150
        `destroying and disposing of the cat under section 34` IS 0
-- (a) 50 + (b) 70 + (c) 60 + (d) 150 + (e) 0 = 330.
#ASSERT `the costs the owner is liable to pay for` `the stray's stay` `:` `the costs` EQUALS 330
#ASSERT `the costs the owner is liable to pay for` `a boarding stay`  `:` `the costs` EQUALS 0

§§ `s 32 — the notice to an identified owner`

GIVEN holding IS A NUMBER
      chip    IS A BOOLEAN
      desex   IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Section 32 notice`
`a notice with holding period` holding `; chip statement` chip `; desex statement` desex MEANS
    `Section 32 notice` WITH
        `states the facility's name and address`                       IS TRUE
        `states the cat may be re-housed, offered for sale or destroyed if not reclaimed` IS TRUE
        `holding period specified, in working days`                    IS holding
        `states the costs the owner may be liable for under s 31`      IS TRUE
        `states the cat is to be microchipped unless shown exempt`     IS chip
        `states the cat is to be sterilised unless shown exempt`       IS desex

#ASSERT `what the s 32 notice` (`a notice with holding period` 7 `; chip statement` FALSE `; desex statement` FALSE) `lacks, where microchipping is relevant:` FALSE `and sterilisation:` FALSE EQUALS (EMPTY)
-- "not to be less than 7 working days".
#ASSERT `what the s 32 notice` (`a notice with holding period` 5 `; chip statement` FALSE `; desex statement` FALSE) `lacks, where microchipping is relevant:` FALSE `and sterilisation:` FALSE EQUALS LIST "(b) a holding period of not less than 7 working days"
-- (d)(i) "where relevant": the cat is believed not microchipped.
#ASSERT `what the s 32 notice` (`a notice with holding period` 7 `; chip statement` FALSE `; desex statement` TRUE)  `lacks, where microchipping is relevant:` TRUE  `and sterilisation:` TRUE  EQUALS LIST "(d)(i) that the cat is to be microchipped"
#ASSERT     `s 32 is contravened during` (`a stay from` (YMD 2025 12 5) `; temporary` FALSE `; owner known` TRUE `; identified` NOTHING `; notified` NOTHING `; holding` 7 `; reclaimed` NOTHING `; surrendered` FALSE `; feral` FALSE `; injurious` FALSE) `, steps taken:` TRUE `, notice lacking:` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `s 32 is contravened during` (`a stay from` (YMD 2025 12 5) `; temporary` FALSE `; owner known` TRUE `; identified` NOTHING `; notified` NOTHING `; holding` 7 `; reclaimed` NOTHING `; surrendered` FALSE `; feral` FALSE `; injurious` FALSE) `, steps taken:` TRUE `, notice lacking:` FALSE
-- Owner not known: s 32 is not engaged.
#ASSERT NOT `s 32 is contravened during` `the stray's stay` `, steps taken:` FALSE `, notice lacking:` TRUE

§§ `s 33 — microchipping and sterilising at the facility`

#ASSERT (`what s 33 permits during` `the stray's stay` `:` TRUE `,` FALSE `,` TRUE `,` TRUE)'s `may have the cat microchipped`
#ASSERT NOT (`what s 33 permits during` `the stray's stay` `:` TRUE `,` FALSE `,` TRUE `,` TRUE)'s `may have the cat sterilised`
#ASSERT NOT (`what s 33 permits during` `a boarding stay` `:` TRUE `,` FALSE `,` TRUE `,` FALSE)'s `may have the cat microchipped`

§§ `s 34 — unidentified and unclaimed cats`

-- (1)(a): entered Fri 5 Dec 2025; 3 working days: Mon 8, Tue 9, Wed 10 Dec.
#ASSERT NOT `on` (YMD 2025 12 10) `the operator may transfer or humanely destroy the cat in` `the stray's stay` `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
#ASSERT     `on` (YMD 2025 12 11) `the operator may transfer or humanely destroy the cat in` `the stray's stay` `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
-- Owner identified on Tue 9 Dec, within the 3 working days: (a) does not apply.
#ASSERT NOT `on` (YMD 2025 12 11) `the operator may transfer or humanely destroy the cat in` (`a stay from` (YMD 2025 12 5) `; temporary` FALSE `; owner known` FALSE `; identified` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 9)) `; notified` NOTHING `; holding` 0 `; reclaimed` NOTHING `; surrendered` FALSE `; feral` FALSE `; injurious` FALSE) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
-- (1)(b): notified Mon 1 Dec 2025 with a 10-working-day holding period.
-- (i) 7 working days end Wed 10 Dec; (ii) 10 end Mon 15 Dec; "whichever is later".
`notified on 1 December, holding 10` MEANS `a stay from` (YMD 2025 11 28) `; temporary` FALSE `; owner known` TRUE `; identified` NOTHING `; notified` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 1)) `; holding` 10 `; reclaimed` NOTHING `; surrendered` FALSE `; feral` FALSE `; injurious` FALSE
#ASSERT `the last day to reclaim the cat in` `notified on 1 December, holding 10` `after notice on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26` EQUALS YMD 2025 12 15
#ASSERT NOT `on` (YMD 2025 12 15) `the operator may transfer or humanely destroy the cat in` `notified on 1 December, holding 10` `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
#ASSERT     `on` (YMD 2025 12 16) `the operator may transfer or humanely destroy the cat in` `notified on 1 December, holding 10` `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
-- A holding period shorter than 7 working days does not shorten (i).
#ASSERT `the last day to reclaim the cat in` (`a stay from` (YMD 2025 11 28) `; temporary` FALSE `; owner known` TRUE `; identified` NOTHING `; notified` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 1)) `; holding` 5 `; reclaimed` NOTHING `; surrendered` FALSE `; feral` FALSE `; injurious` FALSE) `after notice on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26` EQUALS YMD 2025 12 10
-- Over Christmas: notified Wed 24 Dec 2025; 7 working days: Mon 29 (1), Tue 30
-- (2), Wed 31 (3), [Thu 1 Jan holiday], Fri 2 (4), Mon 5 (5), Tue 6 (6), Wed 7 Jan (7).
#ASSERT `the last day to reclaim the cat in` (`a stay from` (YMD 2025 12 20) `; temporary` FALSE `; owner known` TRUE `; identified` NOTHING `; notified` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 24)) `; holding` 7 `; reclaimed` NOTHING `; surrendered` FALSE `; feral` FALSE `; injurious` FALSE) `after notice on` (YMD 2025 12 24) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26` EQUALS YMD 2026 1 7
-- Reclaimed in time: no power.
#ASSERT NOT `on` (YMD 2025 12 20) `the operator may transfer or humanely destroy the cat in` (`a stay from` (YMD 2025 11 28) `; temporary` FALSE `; owner known` TRUE `; identified` NOTHING `; notified` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 1)) `; holding` 10 `; reclaimed` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 12)) `; surrendered` FALSE `; feral` FALSE `; injurious` FALSE) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
-- (1)(c): surrendered.
#ASSERT     `on` (YMD 2025 12 5) `the operator may transfer or humanely destroy the cat in` (`a stay from` (YMD 2025 12 5) `; temporary` FALSE `; owner known` TRUE `; identified` NOTHING `; notified` NOTHING `; holding` 0 `; reclaimed` NOTHING `; surrendered` TRUE `; feral` FALSE `; injurious` FALSE) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
-- (2)(a): feral, diseased or dangerous AND injurious; one without the other is not enough.
#ASSERT     `the operator may immediately destroy the cat in` (`a stay from` (YMD 2025 12 5) `; temporary` FALSE `; owner known` FALSE `; identified` NOTHING `; notified` NOTHING `; holding` 0 `; reclaimed` NOTHING `; surrendered` FALSE `; feral` TRUE `; injurious` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the operator may immediately destroy the cat in` (`a stay from` (YMD 2025 12 5) `; temporary` FALSE `; owner known` FALSE `; identified` NOTHING `; notified` NOTHING `; holding` 0 `; reclaimed` NOTHING `; surrendered` FALSE `; feral` TRUE `; injurious` FALSE)

§§ `s 35 — breeding without approval`

`Fay` MEANS `a breeder named` "Fay" `, member of` (LIST `Cat Owners' Association of Western Australia Incorporated`) `, convicted` EMPTY `, noticed` EMPTY `, approved:` TRUE
`Gus` MEANS `a breeder named` "Gus" `, member of` EMPTY `, convicted` EMPTY `, noticed` EMPTY `, approved:` FALSE

#ASSERT     `s 35(1) is contravened by` `Gus` `, breeding:` TRUE `, on` (YMD 2025 12 1)
#ASSERT NOT `s 35(1) is contravened by` `Fay` `, breeding:` TRUE `, on` (YMD 2025 12 1)
#ASSERT NOT `s 35(1) is contravened by` `Gus` `, breeding:` FALSE `, on` (YMD 2025 12 1)

§§ `s 37 — approval to breed`

GIVEN who        IS A Person
      facilities IS A BOOLEAN
      premises   IS A BOOLEAN
      unfit      IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Breeding application`
`a breeding application by` who `; facilities lacking` facilities `; premises lacking` premises `; unfit` unfit MEANS
    `Breeding application` WITH
        `applicant`               IS who
        `grant or renewal`        IS `a grant`
        `date made`               IS YMD 2026 1 10
        `date determined`         IS YMD 2026 1 20
        `number of breeding cats` IS 2
        `findings`                IS `Breeding application findings` WITH
                                        `no, or insufficient, facilities to breed cats in a safe and ethical way` IS facilities
                                        `no, or unsuitable, premises where cats can be bred in a safe and ethical way` IS premises
                                        `not a fit and proper person to breed cats` IS unfit

-- No ground: the local government is to grant.
#ASSERT `the s 37 determination of` (`a breeding application by` `Gus` `; facilities lacking` FALSE `; premises lacking` FALSE `; unfit` FALSE) `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government is to grant or renew the approval`
-- (e) not fit and proper: may refuse ("may ... only if" — a discretion).
#ASSERT `the s 37 determination of` (`a breeding application by` `Gus` `; facilities lacking` FALSE `; premises lacking` FALSE `; unfit` TRUE) `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government may refuse the application` (LIST "(e) the applicant is not a fit and proper person to breed cats")
-- (b) and (c) together.
#ASSERT `the s 37 determination of` (`a breeding application by` `Gus` `; facilities lacking` TRUE `; premises lacking` TRUE `; unfit` FALSE) `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government may refuse the application` (LIST "(b) the applicant has no, or insufficient, facilities to breed cats in a safe and ethical way", "(c) the applicant has no, or unsuitable, premises where cats can be bred in a safe and ethical way")
-- (d): ONE conviction is enough here (contrast s 9(2)(e)).
`Gus, convicted once` MEANS `a breeder named` "Gus" `, member of` EMPTY `, convicted` (LIST `a conviction on` (YMD 2024 6 1) `under` `the Dog Act 1976`) `, noticed` EMPTY `, approved:` FALSE
#ASSERT `the s 37 determination of` (`a breeding application by` `Gus, convicted once` `; facilities lacking` FALSE `; premises lacking` FALSE `; unfit` FALSE) `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government may refuse the application` (LIST "(d) the applicant has been convicted within the previous 3 years of an offence against this Act, the Dog Act 1976 or the Animal Welfare Act 2002")
-- (a): a child.
#ASSERT `the s 37 determination of` (`a breeding application by` `Bea` `; facilities lacking` FALSE `; premises lacking` FALSE `; unfit` FALSE) `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government may refuse the application` (LIST "(a) the applicant is a child under 18 years of age")
-- s 37(5), reg 23: an adult member of a listed body with no conviction in 3
-- years is not to be refused — even where (b) would otherwise apply.
#ASSERT `the s 37 determination of` (`a breeding application by` `Fay` `; facilities lacking` TRUE `; premises lacking` FALSE `; unfit` FALSE) `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government is not to refuse the application`
-- reg 23(b): a member with a conviction in the 3 years is outside the class,
-- and (d) applies.
`Fay, convicted once` MEANS `a breeder named` "Fay" `, member of` (LIST `Cats United WA Incorporated`) `, convicted` (LIST `a conviction on` (YMD 2025 6 1) `under` `the Cat Act 2011`) `, noticed` EMPTY `, approved:` TRUE
#ASSERT `the s 37 determination of` (`a breeding application by` `Fay, convicted once` `; facilities lacking` FALSE `; premises lacking` FALSE `; unfit` FALSE) `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government may refuse the application` (LIST "(d) the applicant has been convicted within the previous 3 years of an offence against this Act, the Dog Act 1976 or the Animal Welfare Act 2002")
-- reg 22(1), (f): an infringement notice issued and paid within the 12 months
-- before the application (10 Jan 2026): issued 1 Mar 2025 counts; 1 Dec 2024 does not.
GIVEN issued  IS A DATE
      outcome IS AN `Infringement notice outcome`
GIVETH A Person
`Gus with a notice issued` issued `, now` outcome MEANS
    `a breeder named` "Gus" `, member of` EMPTY `, convicted` EMPTY `, noticed` (LIST `Infringement notice record` WITH `date given` IS issued, `outcome` IS outcome) `, approved:` FALSE
#ASSERT `the s 37 determination of` (`a breeding application by` (`Gus with a notice issued` (YMD 2025 3 1) `, now` `paid`) `; facilities lacking` FALSE `; premises lacking` FALSE `; unfit` FALSE) `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government may refuse the application` (LIST "(f) reg 22(1): an infringement notice under the Act was issued to, and paid by, the applicant within the 12 months prior")
#ASSERT `the s 37 determination of` (`a breeding application by` (`Gus with a notice issued` (YMD 2024 12 1) `, now` `paid`) `; facilities lacking` FALSE `; premises lacking` FALSE `; unfit` FALSE) `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government is to grant or renew the approval`
-- reg 22(2): unresolved — consideration may be deferred.
#ASSERT `the s 37 determination of` (`a breeding application by` (`Gus with a notice issued` (YMD 2025 6 1) `, now` `not yet resolved`) `; facilities lacking` FALSE `; premises lacking` FALSE `; unfit` FALSE) `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government may defer consideration until the infringement notice is resolved`
-- A withdrawn notice is neither paid nor unresolved.
#ASSERT `the s 37 determination of` (`a breeding application by` (`Gus with a notice issued` (YMD 2025 6 1) `, now` `withdrawn`) `; facilities lacking` FALSE `; premises lacking` FALSE `; unfit` FALSE) `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government is to grant or renew the approval`
-- s 37(3)-(4): a request not complied with in time.
#ASSERT `the s 37 determination of` (`a breeding application by` `Gus` `; facilities lacking` FALSE `; premises lacking` FALSE `; unfit` FALSE) `, after the request` (JUST (`Information request` WITH `days allowed` IS 21, `complied with in time` IS FALSE)) EQUALS `the local government may refuse to consider the application`

-- reg 24: one year. Granted 10 Jan 2026, it has effect through 9 Jan 2027
-- (Interpretation Act s 62: 12 months from 10 Jan end on 9 Jan).
#ASSERT `the last day of effect of an approval granted on` (YMD 2026 1 10) EQUALS YMD 2027 1 9

§§ `s 38 — cancellation`

`no adverse findings` MEANS `Breeding application findings` WITH
    `no, or insufficient, facilities to breed cats in a safe and ethical way` IS FALSE
    `no, or unsuitable, premises where cats can be bred in a safe and ethical way` IS FALSE
    `not a fit and proper person to breed cats` IS FALSE
`found unfit` MEANS `Breeding application findings` WITH
    `no, or insufficient, facilities to breed cats in a safe and ethical way` IS FALSE
    `no, or unsuitable, premises where cats can be bred in a safe and ethical way` IS FALSE
    `not a fit and proper person to breed cats` IS TRUE

-- s 37(5) protects grant and renewal, not an existing approval.
#ASSERT     `on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `the local government may cancel the approval of` `Fay` `, found` `found unfit`
#ASSERT NOT `on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `the local government may cancel the approval of` `Fay` `, found` `no adverse findings`
#ASSERT NOT `on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `the local government may cancel the approval of` `Gus` `, found` `found unfit`

§§ `s 40 — notice of a breeding decision`

GIVEN dec   IS A `Reviewable decision`
      on    IS A DATE
      given IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH AN `Objection history`
`a breeding decision` dec `made on` on `, notified on` given MEANS
    `Objection history` WITH
        `decision`                                   IS dec
        `date of the decision`                       IS on
        `date notice of the decision was given`      IS given
        `date objection lodged`                      IS NOTHING
        `further time allowed by the local government, in days` IS 0
        `date notice of disposal of the objection given` IS NOTHING
        `date review applied for`                    IS NOTHING

#ASSERT NOT `the s 40 notice is late, as at` (YMD 2026 1 20) `, for` (`a breeding decision` `refusal to grant an approval to breed` `made on` (YMD 2026 1 5) `, notified on` (JUST (YMD 2026 1 12))) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
#ASSERT     `the s 40 notice is late, as at` (YMD 2026 1 20) `, for` (`a breeding decision` `cancellation of an approval to breed` `made on` (YMD 2026 1 5) `, notified on` (JUST (YMD 2026 1 13))) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
#ASSERT NOT `the s 40 notice is late, as at` (YMD 2026 1 20) `, for` (`a breeding decision` `refusal to grant registration` `made on` (YMD 2026 1 5) `, notified on` NOTHING) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`

§§ `s 41 — prizes`

#ASSERT     `s 41 is contravened, where the person` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `s 41 is contravened, where the person` FALSE
